<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/001579c2-0a0e-4a71-a2f6-984eb5b5c9da> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/30e45192-cd0e-479f-ba52-0b7aad475394> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/001579c2-0a0e-4a71-a2f6-984eb5b5c9da> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/3bd26ec5-16d9-4652-8d22-6133ab4469ac> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/001579c2-0a0e-4a71-a2f6-984eb5b5c9da> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/001579c2-0a0e-4a71-a2f6-984eb5b5c9da> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Of 98,220 noun entries, the 49,002 containing a space are dropped: one word in can never match them and no one-word rule output can be one. Single-token lower-case lemmas (44,543) form NOUNS — rule targets and known words. The 4,114 single-token lemmas written only capitalised (Ga, Kansas, Mr, Baptists) form NAMES — known words (returned unchanged) but never a rule target. This removes 48 lower-casing collisions (gas→ga, pus→pu, Kansas→Kansa, Mrs→Mr). Hyphenated/apostrophe/digit single tokens are kept (cheap; callers may pass them). No lemma contains '_'." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
