<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/06808e4a-34cf-4b99-8b7d-04d06fde23a6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "D1: Packed newline-joined noun index" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/06808e4a-34cf-4b99-8b7d-04d06fde23a6> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/30e45192-cd0e-479f-ba52-0b7aad475394> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/06808e4a-34cf-4b99-8b7d-04d06fde23a6> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/b9851667-ab87-40ac-bffd-99cd5802ffd2> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/06808e4a-34cf-4b99-8b7d-04d06fde23a6> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/06808e4a-34cf-4b99-8b7d-04d06fde23a6> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "NOUNS and NAMES are each one sorted, newline-joined &'static str (include_str! of src/nouns.txt / src/names.txt), binary-searched over byte offsets (walk back to the previous \\n). Small tables (forms, policy) stay &[(&str, &str)]. Measured on 48.6k single-token nouns (macOS arm64, release, stripped): packed +0.48 MB binary / 456 KB source / 0.2 s build vs &[&str] +1.2 MB / 788 KB / 0.6 s — most of the array cost is 16-byte fat pointers plus one relocation per entry. Still static, sorted, allocation-free, nothing parsed at startup." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/06808e4a-34cf-4b99-8b7d-04d06fde23a6> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
