<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/0ab8dddd-d78e-4848-96d4-a3182bd64114> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "singularize/pluralize (free functions and Inflector methods) return Cow<'_, str>: Borrowed when the word comes back unchanged, Owned otherwise. Changes the skeleton's documented `-> String` API before 0.1.0 is published (user decision). Cow<str> == &str still works in asserts; crate docs, README and the tests/cases.rs harness are updated to match." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/0ab8dddd-d78e-4848-96d4-a3182bd64114> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
