<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/195bc085-97d3-4f98-a026-c8670dad8945> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P4: -oes/-ves plurals only where WordNet lists them (no mechanical filter)" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/195bc085-97d3-4f98-a026-c8670dad8945> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/30e45192-cd0e-479f-ba52-0b7aad475394> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
