<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2a19ead0-9a68-46f6-a18f-8783bd4a8078> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2a19ead0-9a68-46f6-a18f-8783bd4a8078> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P8: Plural-shaped noun lemmas count as already plural" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2a19ead0-9a68-46f6-a18f-8783bd4a8078> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/3bd26ec5-16d9-4652-8d22-6133ab4469ac> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2a19ead0-9a68-46f6-a18f-8783bd4a8078> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/5716d820-8bd9-4f9e-90b0-257b9c4a72f2> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2a19ead0-9a68-46f6-a18f-8783bd4a8078> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/64a11323-9da6-405a-a37e-4f3eb843e98a> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2a19ead0-9a68-46f6-a18f-8783bd4a8078> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/b9851667-ab87-40ac-bffd-99cd5802ffd2> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2a19ead0-9a68-46f6-a18f-8783bd4a8078> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2a19ead0-9a68-46f6-a18f-8783bd4a8078> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "pluralize leaves a WordNet noun unchanged when singularize keeps it, it ends in `s` after anything other than a/i/o/u/y (a consonant, `e`, a digit or an apostrophe) but not `ss` or `-sis`, and WordNet lists no plural form for it. A curated Apache-2.0 list S_REGULAR in src/policy.rs holds the few real singulars of that shape that still take the regular plural (lens, summons, yes). The generator checks that each entry is a WordNet noun of that shape, and `cargo xtask report` prints the class size so a WordNet bump that moves it is visible. This refines P7 (recognised plurals) and fixes GitHub issue #1.\n\nEvidence, measured on 0.1.0 over src/nouns.txt: 1,801 lemmas ending in a bare `s` that singularize keeps are changed by pluralize. Consonant/digit/apostrophe + s: 338, nearly all non-words (thankses, avionicses, 1990ses). Only lens and summons are right; 8 more are WordNet forms (glans→glandes, man-at-arms→men-at-arms) and stay right. e + s: 94, nearly all non-words (clotheses, measleses, diabeteses); only yes→yeses is right. a/i/o/u/y + s: 1,369, mostly genuine singulars (bus, status, iris, -itis), so left alone." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2a19ead0-9a68-46f6-a18f-8783bd4a8078> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2a19ead0-9a68-46f6-a18f-8783bd4a8078> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-10-18T00:56:20.131013Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
