<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/38a00457-4bbe-47eb-a286-5dd95c9c97fb> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "D8: Case restoration by origin-aware per-character copy" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/38a00457-4bbe-47eb-a286-5dd95c9c97fb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/20157892-bc76-4766-9c99-df01009eb71b> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/38a00457-4bbe-47eb-a286-5dd95c9c97fb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/b9851667-ab87-40ac-bffd-99cd5802ffd2> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/38a00457-4bbe-47eb-a286-5dd95c9c97fb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/38a00457-4bbe-47eb-a286-5dd95c9c97fb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Lookup key: an ASCII word of 64 bytes or fewer is lower-cased in a stack buffer; other words use an allocating to_lowercase. Case is restored per input character: wherever a character's whole lowercase expansion matches, the original characters are kept over the shared prefix and tail (İstanbul→İstanbuls, Mothers-in-Law→Mother-in-Law). Title Case in gives Title Case out. For all-caps input, the resolver passes an explicit Origin:\n- Rule: the plural is the key plus s/es, whether from a rule, a WordNet form, a choice or an override. The appended letters are lower case (ISBN→ISBNs, BOX→BOXes, SKU→SKUs, OS→OSes).\n- Form: any other shape. The letters follow the word's case (CHILD→CHILDREN, OX→OXEN, MOUSE→MICE, PERSON→PEOPLE).\nThe Cow is Borrowed exactly when the final restored string equals the input." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/38a00457-4bbe-47eb-a286-5dd95c9c97fb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/38a00457-4bbe-47eb-a286-5dd95c9c97fb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/97dcde84-dd7b-4ae2-a8ba-ce1f89082f71> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
