<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/38a00457-4bbe-47eb-a286-5dd95c9c97fb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/6538dee2-6875-4847-9405-1661755ffed8> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3e938470-86f0-4481-884d-beb45002420c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3e938470-86f0-4481-884d-beb45002420c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P5: Prefer the modern plural over archaic WordNet forms" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3e938470-86f0-4481-884d-beb45002420c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/5716d820-8bd9-4f9e-90b0-257b9c4a72f2> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3e938470-86f0-4481-884d-beb45002420c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3e938470-86f0-4481-884d-beb45002420c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "PLURAL_CHOICE may override a lemma's single WordNet form with the plural modern English uses: brother→brothers (WordNet lists only brethren), stadium→stadiums, zero→zeros, camera→cameras (camerae is a legal sense), forum→forums. The value must be a WordNet form of the lemma or the rule plural. Latin plurals that are standard stay as they are: index→indices, medium→media, antenna→antennae. Singularize still maps the WordNet form back (stadia→stadium, brethren→brother). IRREGULAR is reserved for pairs WordNet lacks entirely: person/people, woman/women, alga, bacterium, schoolchild." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3e938470-86f0-4481-884d-beb45002420c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3e938470-86f0-4481-884d-beb45002420c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-10-17T19:10:47.968913Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3e938470-86f0-4481-884d-beb45002420c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "P5: Prefer the modern plural over archaic WordNet forms" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3e938470-86f0-4481-884d-beb45002420c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#isMotivatedBy> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/a3e3108a-6c7f-46ea-b998-7c938688f5a6> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
