<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c677393-7310-4f70-833d-a061732c38eb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/30e45192-cd0e-479f-ba52-0b7aad475394> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c677393-7310-4f70-833d-a061732c38eb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/cdaaaded-bd10-485e-a590-f298e66ab80d> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
