<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c677393-7310-4f70-833d-a061732c38eb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "This applies only to words WordNet doesn't contain in any part of speech. A word listed in OTHERS (single-token non-noun lemmas ending in -s, such as perhaps, sometimes, besides, indoors) is returned unchanged. The fallback runs only on lower-case [a-z] words of at least 4 letters.\nRules:\n- -ies→-y after a consonant;\n- sibilant + es→strip es;\n- -s→strip after a consonant or after e.\nA result is accepted only if it, or a proper suffix of it at least 3 letters long, is a WordNet noun (the known-head check: microservices→microservice via \"service\", while lach, aby and kubernete are refused). Otherwise the word is returned unchanged.\nLeft unchanged:\n- compounds of an invariant noun (superspecies, biomechanics);\n- the endings -as, -is, -us, -ss, -os, -ys, -ics, -ities, -wards, -selves, -ops, vowel+ses, -sses, -etes, -ales, -iformes, -ides, -facies;\n- capitalised words, and words with digits or symbols.\npluralize leaves recognised plurals and OTHERS words unchanged (P7)." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c677393-7310-4f70-833d-a061732c38eb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "superseded" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c677393-7310-4f70-833d-a061732c38eb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/9ff2191b-ca12-4da1-b4ea-b67a9508c88f> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
