<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c8e818d-52b6-45c0-a39d-c111a44c6f6c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c8e818d-52b6-45c0-a39d-c111a44c6f6c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "The generator is xtask/ (publish = false) in a workspace rooted at the moult package, invoked as `cargo xtask` via .cargo/config.toml. Deps: quick-xml, flate2, sha2, ureq, toml. Subcommands: report, gen-data [--check], inflect, size. It shares src/rules.rs and src/policy.rs via #[path] to simulate the runtime and validate policy without a circular dependency or hidden public API. The package include list already excludes xtask/, data/, .cargo/. Cargo.lock is committed so generator builds are reproducible." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c8e818d-52b6-45c0-a39d-c111a44c6f6c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
