<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/5f94288a-36c5-4b9d-a024-dde8dd385cd9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "D9: Phrase entry points inflect the last word" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
