<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8b442d17-b6d3-49ea-955b-6600cb36c4c6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8b442d17-b6d3-49ea-955b-6600cb36c4c6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P3: Conservative fallback for unknown words (tightened)" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8b442d17-b6d3-49ea-955b-6600cb36c4c6> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/cdaaaded-bd10-485e-a590-f298e66ab80d> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8b442d17-b6d3-49ea-955b-6600cb36c4c6> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8b442d17-b6d3-49ea-955b-6600cb36c4c6> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "This applies only to words WordNet doesn't contain, and only to lower-case [a-z] words of at least 4 letters; the acronym-plural shape is handled earlier.\nRules:\n- -ies→-y after a consonant;\n- sibilant + es→strip es;\n- -s→strip after a consonant or after e.\nLeft unchanged:\n- compounds of an invariant noun, i.e. the word ends with an INVARIANT entry of at least 4 letters (superspecies, subseries, biomechanics);\n- the endings -as, -is, -us, -ss, -os, -ys, -ics, -ities, -wards, -selves, -ops, vowel+ses (moses, rameses), -sses, -etes (kubernetes), and the taxon endings -ales, -iformes, -ides;\n- capitalised words, and words containing digits or symbols.\npluralize uses the rule plural for unknown words, and leaves unchanged an unknown word that already looks plural (P7)." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8b442d17-b6d3-49ea-955b-6600cb36c4c6> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "superseded" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8b442d17-b6d3-49ea-955b-6600cb36c4c6> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/aa62790f-597f-4e47-bfc8-b07b48f6d599> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
