<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d513e420-6688-4b55-92c3-10b5cb2c4570> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/30e45192-cd0e-479f-ba52-0b7aad475394> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
