<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fc760bb9-03a7-48dd-88bb-9850b9951804> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P1: Strip wins by default; refuse only genuinely ambiguous classes" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fc760bb9-03a7-48dd-88bb-9850b9951804> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/3bd26ec5-16d9-4652-8d22-6133ab4469ac> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fc760bb9-03a7-48dd-88bb-9850b9951804> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/5716d820-8bd9-4f9e-90b0-257b9c4a72f2> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fc760bb9-03a7-48dd-88bb-9850b9951804> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/cdaaaded-bd10-485e-a590-f298e66ab80d> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fc760bb9-03a7-48dd-88bb-9850b9951804> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fc760bb9-03a7-48dd-88bb-9850b9951804> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Class A, where the input and its stripped form are both nouns (glasses/glass, arms, goods, metrics; about 460 in OEWN 2025): stripping wins and the invariant list overrides it (physics, data, news). No row-by-row list. The generator refuses until classified only these genuinely ambiguous classes:\n- B1: two lemmas share one regular plural (79: cookies, senses, corpses).\n- B2: a form points at 2+ lemmas (32: leaves→leaf, axes→axis, bases, taxes).\n- C: an irregular form is also a noun (45: men→man, teeth→tooth; stamina, cola and trivia are kept).\n- D: a lemma has 2+ plural forms (37, typos included).\nThe refused total is about 193. The generator prints each unclassified entry as a ready-to-paste line with a suggestion (sense count, then the drop-only-s spelling). Gate: if the generator's own count for B, C and D is in the thousands, stop and choose a structural tie-break before writing lists. people→person and women→woman come from the curated supplement because WordNet lacks them. Once this policy is stated, leaves and axes join tests/cases.rs." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fc760bb9-03a7-48dd-88bb-9850b9951804> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
