<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/8a614569-dd37-410b-8bff-879ea8796e10> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Lookup is case-insensitive; output keeps the input's case pattern (ISBNs→ISBN, IDs→ID, Territories→Territory). singularize, pluralize and is_noun take one word; input containing whitespace is returned unchanged (is_noun: false). singularize_phrase and pluralize_phrase inflect only the final whitespace-separated word and keep everything else byte-for-byte. Splitting identifiers (camelCase, snake_case) and choosing the head of a head-initial compound stay the caller's job." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
